      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pleasanton%2C_Nebraska",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Pleasanton earned its name from the gentle Pleasant Valley of the Loup River that surrounds the village.",
